==Strategy==
The majority of enemies in this stage are [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], meaning that Anti-Red units such as [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] should easily take care of them. As for Gokurakko, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] should be enough to hold them back. [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist]] can deal massive damage to all enemies in the stage with the Target Angel [[Talents|Talent]] unlocked.

This stage can also be [[cheese]]d with the help of Starting Money Up [[Cat Combo|combos]] such as [[Bouncing Four (Combo)|Bouncing Four]], [[Offshore Accounts (Combo)|Offshore Accounts]] and [[Bento Special (Combo)|Bento Special]]. The last one includes Sushi Cat which also comes in handy to hold enemies back while other units destroy the base. The second row will be the following: [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]. Once the battle starts, spawn units in the following order as fast as possible, with no delays: Eraser, Can Can, Roe, Courier, Bullet Train, Bahamut. Then keep spawning Courier, Can Can and BTrain until you win.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Thundia β]]: Due to this stage being nearly being completely comprised of Red enemies, she expectedly destroys this stage. Even without Talents, her chaining both hits allows her to deal a whopping '''776,000''' damage, more than enough to one-shot every Red enemy in this stage save for St. Pigge the 2nd and Johnnyleon. Only counting her second hit, she can one-shot Raynard while doing over half of Hackey's HP.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: A great supporter-attacker hybrid for this stage. She is Strong against Red enemies while being able to Freeze them as well.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]]: Bring him to this stage specifically to kill the Gokurakkos. His general damage is good enough to deal with the Red enemies too.
*[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|Unit-02, Code 777]]: An alternative to Ultimate Thundia if you do not have her. Do mind that it is not as easy to use as she is, as it has a notable blind spot that enemies, especially Gokurakko can push into if left unchecked. To counterbalance this, make sure to bring Anti-Angel units to stall and/or kill them.
*[[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Alluring Dancer]]: A great generalist melee attacker for this stage witha relatively low cost, high DPS, speed, and spammability.
*[[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai DX]]: Destroys this stage with her combination of Insane Resist and Massive Damage against Red enemies.

